    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "貝澳，石灘。子夜。烏雲比傍晚更密。月亮只露一角。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "素婷沒有追出來。家綸也不在。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "芷君。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我是不是很傻？",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "是哦。你的確很傻。",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "謝謝你。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "別人說你傻，也值得道謝？",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "不，謝謝你陪伴我。每次我有煩惱，不也是你陪著。這個時候我來看你，是應該的。我已經跟莊員說過，你可能只是一時意氣。我看著你，等你下了火。我叫他們不用跟來。",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "你到底在想甚麼？",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
